[164.65, "o", "filler.md:3:1:Deslop.SlopVocab:'It is important to note' is an AI-slop tell. Cut it or say the thing plainly.\r\nfiller.md:3:1:STE.FillerPhrases:Delete the filler 'It is important to note'.\r\nfiller.md:3:40:Deslop.HedgeCascade:Hedge cascade: 'may'. Use one qualifier, not two: may potentially.\r\nfiller.md:3:40:ai-tells.StackedHedges:AI stacked hedge: 'may potentially'. Drop one hedge, or give a number instead.\r\nfiller.md:3:84:Deslop.Substitutions:Use 'strong' instead of 'robust'.\r\nfiller.md:3:84:ai-tells.OverusedVocabulary:AI vocabulary: 'robust'. Replace with a more specific or common word.\r\nfiller.md:3:84:STE.Marketing:'robust' is marketing language. State the fact.\r\nfiller.md:3:95:Deslop.SlopVocab:'seamless' is an AI-slop tell. Cut it or say the thing plainly.\r\nfiller.md:3:95:STE.Marketing:'seamless' is marketing language. State the fact.\r\nfiller.md:3:95:ai-tells.AIAdjectiveNounPairs:AI adjective-noun pair: 'seamless way'. Use concrete description instead.\r\n"]
